# Concoct Archive prompt

- Persona: `archivist`
- Workflow state: `review-approved`
- Mode: `archival`
- Latest review: `review-01.md` (`approved`)

## Effective instruction sources

- Layer `protocol`; source `.concoct/protocol.md`
- Layer `policy`; source `.concoct/policy.md`
